domain MeasurementReadback:
  description "Bounded recommendations from the single long-timeout experiment."
evidence SDK:
  "Five provider attempts completed and returned usage; two Luna calls took approximately 3.8 and 7.3 seconds."
evidence REJECTION:
  "Runtime is incomplete at tick0 with reflexDesires[0].action expected object received string."
evidence LEDGERS:
  "Provider ledger marks all five calls completed while four runtime reservations retain physicalOutstanding true."
premise UNKNOWN:
  "The actual generated payload was not retained. Why action became a string and the producing condition of stale reservations remain unknown. Price has not been independently validated."
premise SCOPE:
  "Owner authorized one extended-timeout measurement. Further implementation or another paid trial is a successor task."
decision NEXT based_on SDK, REJECTION, LEDGERS, UNKNOWN, SCOPE:
  "Recommend reviewing the explicit output contract and reservation settlement after terminal schema failure before another paid trial. Preserve observations and stop this measurement without retries."
